---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Helping Hand" description="Ways to support Sarvagun Society — become a member, spend time with us, or spread the word.">
  <section class="py-16 lg:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[var(--spacing-page)] px-4 lg:px-6">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-heading font-bold mb-6">Lend a Helping Hand</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-text-muted mb-10">Money is required to support good causes, but it is not the only element we can expect from others. Here are other meaningful ways to support us.</p>

      <div class="grid gap-6">
        <div class="bg-bg-card rounded-lg border border-border p-6 lg:p-8">
          <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-xl mb-3 text-primary">Be a Part of Sarvagun Society</h2>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">If you believe like the Sarvagun team that you can make a difference, join us as a member. Pick an area of interest and contribute by collaborating with our volunteers.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-bg-card rounded-lg border border-border p-6 lg:p-8">
          <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-xl mb-3 text-primary">Spend Time With Us</h2>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">Join our mailing list and stay updated about all our activities. Be part of our meetings, discussions, and give your valuable inputs.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-bg-card rounded-lg border border-border p-6 lg:p-8">
          <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-xl mb-3 text-primary">Spread the Word</h2>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">If you lack time for direct involvement, spread the word. Tell people about Sarvagun Society's website or share our contact details. You never know who might be the most needed person for this cause.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
